[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":98},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":27,"_29":30,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":36,"_37":38,"_39":40,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":36,"_55":56,"_57":58,"_59":36,"_60":61},"expiresAt",1795567292000,"id","w3kx214fo5k5ijxfsr4l8s88y","title","AWS 完成第二次 ISO/IEC 42001:2023 监督审核，无发现并新增 AWS DevOps Agent 认证范围","originalTitle","AWS completed its second ISO/IEC 42001:2023 surveillance audit","summary","AWS 于 2026 年 11 月完成第二次 ISO/IEC 42001:2023 人工智能管理体系监督审核，结果无发现，并将 AWS DevOps Agent 纳入认证服务范围。","reason","source",{"_71":97},"links",{"_61":96},"publishedAt","2026-11-24T18:32:21.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-24T19:03:35.531Z","timelineAt","category","policy","tags",[91,92,93,94,95],"score",23,"selected",false,"channel","news","story",{"_76":77,"_13":78},"x","readingMode","full","author","Basit Janjua","body",{"_87":-5,"_61":88,"_89":-5,"_90":36},"outline",[79,80],"relatedStories",[75],"topics",[68,69],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group",{"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67},"hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","factId","feAdxaOESASQ","reportCount",1,"additionalSourceCount",0,{"_70":73,"_71":74},{"_70":30,"_71":72},"slug","name","政策法规","ai-agent","AI Agent 安全",{"_76":77,"_13":78},"publicId","ae41802a-af74-4594-85dc-b44c3f811245","AWS完成ISO 42001第二次监督审核",{"_11":86,"_82":45,"_84":85},{"_11":81,"_82":83,"_84":85},"sec-2","text","Shalini Mishra","level",3,"sec-1","zh","<p>In November 2024, <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/\">Amazon Web Services (AWS)</a></span> was the first major cloud service provider to announce the ISO/IEC 42001 accredited certification for AI services, covering <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/bedrock\">Amazon Bedrock</a></span>, <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/q/business/\">Amazon Q Business</a></span>, <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/textract\">Amazon Textract</a></span>, and <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/transcribe/\">Amazon Transcribe</a></span>.</p><p>In November 2026, AWS successfully completed its second surveillance audit for <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/iso-42001-faqs/\">ISO 42001:2023</a></span>, Artificial Intelligence Management System (AIMS), with no findings and added <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/devops-agent/\">AWS DevOps Agent </a></span>as a new service now covered under its <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/iso-42001-faqs/\">ISO 42001:2023</a></span> certification program.</p><p>This demonstrates the continuous commitment by AWS to responsible AI practices. With this independent validation, our customers can gain assurances on our commitment to responsible AI that enables customers to build and operate AI applications responsibly using AWS services.</p><p>For a full list of AWS services that are certified under ISO and CSA STAR, see the AWS <span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/iso-certified\"><u>ISO and CSA STAR Certified</u></a></span> page. Customers can also access the certifications through the <span><a href=\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/artifact\"><u>AWS Management Console</u></a></span> for AWS Artifact.</p><p>If you have questions about this post, contact <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/contact-us/\">AWS Support</a> or start a new thread on <a href=\"https://repost.aws/\">AWS re:Post</a>.</p><hr><p> \n   <img src=\"/dailyinfo/media/379837586bc3d032.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Basit Janjua\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\">\n  </p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">Basit Janjua</h3><p>Basit is a Senior Security Industry Specialist at AWS. He leads the AWS assurance delivery strategy for security assurance audits and engagements across the globe. Basit has nearly 20 years of experience in information security engineering and assurance. He holds a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science and a Master’s degree in Telecommunications, along with professional certifications including CISSP and CCSP. </p><p> \n   <img src=\"/dailyinfo/media/abaa08023e57f25f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Shalini Mishra\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\">\n  </p><h3 id=\"sec-2\">Shalini Mishra</h3><p>Shalini is a Compliance Program Manager at AWS. She has over 5 years of experience leading end-to-end compliance programs across ISO, SOC, and cloud security frameworks, with deep expertise in third-party risk management and enterprise governance, driving measurable improvements in security posture and audit readiness. Shalini holds a Master of Science degree in Information Systems, CRISC and ISO 27001 lead auditor certification.</p>","zhKind","complete","标准","治理","大模型","Agent 安全","AWS","https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/security/aws-completed-its-second-iso-iec-420012023-surveillance-audit/","AWS Security Blog",{"_99":100,"_101":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
